vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GZAnhKnPpCUQ7kNvwHysi61&_nc_oc=Adm1DcENiPOHzwGbtaxi436--qAT_HVaTVSRCfmWzo53gi2U5ziD9ljjFb94ovmC0mM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy-ND8V7U6r5MeiftU1jN3SXn1T-LbJADAyN4BfZxTX4Q&oe=69B40B54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aoRWBZkJJVIQ7kNvwHUomQi&_nc_oc=AdlCBXXMh8UlVo8qPWvR54a-eolEvOcD3hak_0uLGeuRK8QVOTPjtQok11ytL0eQ-G0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyVBcFXpdHOQloR3ZT1bcnji8qPOhjfSaj6ubQMyYQ_Sg&oe=69B41032"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TCSeBSB3KOgQ7kNvwEvVsDE&_nc_oc=Adllbv_7uAOTSI3jF6D2Q1lshSwc6cuEcMaes2-le5xamlZn_4gr2VhT2hNs0MIEolI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzyOP-bc3UkwpMnVHmLiSolSxuBbFXSyLMpVCfgrZDlKA&oe=69B41DD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "